<BlogPost title="About Colombia Force" description="An independent outlet that summarizes, in plain language, the Colombian state's actions against crime." pubDate={new Date('2026-09-23')}>
  <p>Colombia Force publishes a short daily report on operations, seizures, surrenders and results of the offensive against crime in Colombia, based on official data and with a map by department.</p>
  <p>We are an independent outlet and have no ties to the government. To learn how we work, read our <a href="/en/politica-editorial">editorial policy</a> or write to us through the <a href="/en/contacto">contact page</a>.</p>
